title: Setup
---
/// Whether player talked with Mira.
<<declare $metMira = false>>
===
title: intro
---
Narrator: You enter a quiet courtyard.
Mira: Hello! Want to talk or look around?
-> Talk with Mira
    <<set $metMira = true>>
    <<jump MeetMira>>
-> Explore the courtyard
    <<set $metMira = false>>
    <<jump ExploreCourtyard>>
===
title: MeetMira
---
Mira: I enjoy meeting visitors.
<<jump Ending>>
===
title: ExploreCourtyard
---
Narrator: Sunlight shines over old stones.
<<jump Ending>>
===
title: Ending
---
<<if $metMira>>
    Mira: See you tomorrow!
<<else>>
    Narrator: You leave before sunset.
<<endif>>
Narrator: End of Hello Story.
===
